          "text": "--> Inpainting: Adding Custom Models with LetzAI\n\nI have been testing LetzAI's new inpainting feature, embedding custom models in my images.\n\nIt is insanely accurate and such a great use case.\n\nLet's look at some examples, and the steps I took to make it happen!",
