          "text": "We've solved Virtual Try-On, again.\n\nWhen we launched LetzAI V3 in September last year, people went crazy over its fashion-related use cases.\n\nBut there was a problem: \n\"Generate any person wearing any outfit\" worked well for some use cases, but not for all of them. \n\nOur new",
